  "body": "The algorithms provided in https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#es-buffer-source-types are a little shaky as the [AllowResizable] and [AllowShared] extended attributes end up changing the IDL type. Thus in principle these algorithms cannot be used if you have an IDL object for a view that points to a shared buffer, for instance.\r\n\r\nProperly changing the types to be maximally inclusive would have some downstream repercussions and we'd also want to be careful that whatever maximally-inclusive IDL typedef we create here can be used for any future expansions of these buffers as well, should they happen. (Unless we're happy to do this again, but meh.)",
